# 41. Supabase Policies

Before declaring the backend complete, explicitly inspect and verify:

* RLS enabled on every exposed table
* Public SELECT policies are limited to active catalogue data
* Anonymous users cannot read orders
* Anonymous users cannot read customer information
* Anonymous users cannot update orders
* Anonymous users cannot modify product prices
* Anonymous users cannot modify inventory
* Order creation cannot arbitrarily set authoritative financial values
* Service-role credentials are never exposed to the frontend

Do not proceed merely because the application works in the browser.

The database security model must also be correct.

---

