# 43. Definition of Done

The project is not finished when the UI looks good.

It is finished when a real customer can:

1. Click a Manvelle ad.
2. Land on the storefront.
3. Browse products.
4. View product details.
5. Select a size.
6. Select quantity.
7. Add to cart.
8. Checkout without creating an account.
9. Submit their name, phone and delivery information.
10. Create a real Supabase order.
11. Receive a unique Manvelle order number.
12. See an accurate order summary.
13. Move to WhatsApp for communication.
14. Have the order fulfilled using the recorded information.
15. Have the order eventually marked delivered/paid.

And the business owner must be able to determine:

**How many people visited?**

**How many viewed products?**

**How many started checkout?**

**How many placed orders?**

**How many orders were delivered?**

**How many customers actually paid?**

**Which products generated those customers?**

The system must create the foundation for answering these questions.

